.md:185:  -> validation expectations\nREADME.md:192:validation and harness maintenance expectations.\nREADME.md:246:- `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`: behavior-to-proof control panel.\nREADME.md:283:- Propose validation patterns for different stacks.\nREADME.md:296:> agents: AGENTS.md, product contracts, story packets, validation matrix, and\ndocs/decisions/0007-improvement-proposal-rules.md:28:- validation plan,\ndocs/decisions/0007-improvement-proposal-rules.md:33:validation requirements, or risk policy.\ndocs/decisions/0004-sqlite-durable-layer.md:32:- **Stories**: work packets and their validation proof status (replaces manual\ndocs/decisions/0003-generic-spec-intake-harness.md:12:candidate epics, architecture assumptions, and validation examples. That made\ndocs/decisions/0003-generic-spec-intake-harness.md:18:intake, story, proof, and decision loop.\ndocs/decisions/0003-generic-spec-intake-harness.md:31:- Stack-neutral validation columns.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
